## 4. V1 → V2 Token & Class Mapping Table

| V1 | V2 |
|---|---|
| `#10B981` (emerald green) | `var(--brand-deep-blue)` or `var(--fin-up)` depending on context |
| `#0EA5E9` (sky blue) | `var(--brand-light-blue)` / `var(--brand-cloud-blue)` tint |
| `#EC4899` (pink) | `var(--brand-yellow)` (accent) |
| `--primary-green: #10B981` | `--primary-green: #173d47` (token remapped) |
| `--gradient-primary: linear-gradient(...)` | `--gradient-primary: var(--brand-deep-blue)` |
| `linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981, #0EA5E9)` | `var(--brand-deep-blue)` |
| `#E2E8F0` (border) | `var(--border-subtle)` = `rgba(23,61,71,0.13)` |
| `#0F172A` (text primary) | `var(--text-primary)` = `#173d47` |
| `#475569` (text secondary) | `var(--text-secondary)` = `#3d6b78` |
| `background: var(--gradient-primary)` on button | `background: var(--brand-deep-blue)` |
| `background: white` (card) | `background: var(--brand-white)` |
| `border: 2px solid var(--border-subtle)` (card) | `border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle)` |
| `font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif` | `font-family: var(--font-body)` |
| `font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif` | `font-family: var(--font-body)` |
| `outline: ... var(--primary-green)` | `outline: ... var(--brand-deep-blue)` |
| `.btn-primary { background: var(--primary-green) }` | `.btn-primary { background: var(--brand-deep-blue) }` |
| `.success { background: #059669 }` | `.success { background: var(--fin-up) }` |
| `.error { color: #EF4444 }` | `.error { color: var(--error) }` |
| `.warning { color: #F59E0B }` | `.warning { color: var(--warning) }` = `#b8a030` |
| V1 teal circle SVG logo | `<img src="NewLogo/Unera White Text Nav.svg" class="nav-logo-img" height="24">` |
| Lucide/Heroicons/stroke SVGs | Material Symbols Outlined inline SVG with `fill="currentColor"` |
| Emoji in UI | Material Symbols Outlined inline SVG (see `newunera-icons.mdc`) |

