## 5. What to Preserve Without Exception

- All form fields: `<input>`, `<select>`, `<textarea>` — every `type`, `id`, `name`, `autocomplete`, `required`, `placeholder`, `autofocus`
- All `<label for>` associations
- All `aria-*` attributes (`aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `aria-modal`, `aria-labelledby`, `aria-current`, `aria-expanded`, `role`, etc.)
- All `<script>` inline JS blocks — entire body, unchanged
- All external `<script src>` references — adjust only the relative path for `NewUnera/` location
- All `id` attributes used by JS selectors
- All copy: page `<title>`, `h1`, `h2`, `p`, `label`, `placeholder`, `aria-label`, `alt`, button text, link text, hint text, error message text, trust-bar text, modal title/body, commented copy
- All commented HTML blocks — re-style if they have inline styles, but keep them commented
- All step IDs (`#stepEmail`, `#stepDetails`, etc.) and their show/hide logic
- All link `href` targets (adjust relative paths for `NewUnera/` location as needed)
- Multi-step query-string behavior (`?step=details&verified=true`, etc.)

