## 6. Reference Files Priority Order

When building components or copying patterns, use this priority:

| Priority | File | Best for |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `NewUnera/dashboard-enhanced.html` | `:root` tokens, `@font-face`, nav, buttons, cards, skip link |
| 2 | `NewUnera/wallet-enhanced.html` | Fin semantic tokens, `.btn-danger`, soft/ring tokens, data tables |
| 3 | `NewUnera/kyc-verify.html` | `.widget-card`, stepped flows, upload zones, `btn-row` |
| 4 | `NewUnera/add-money.html` | `.form-group`, `.form-input`, `.btn-actions`, modal form patterns |
| 5 | `NewUnera/exchange.html` | Confirm steps, dropdown patterns, multi-step flow |
| 6 | `NewUnera/get-unera-cad.html` / `redeem-unera-cad.html` | Flow surface tokens, processing trackers, success hero |
| 7 | `NewUnera/brand-style-guide.html` | Token reference only — never copy layout from here to product pages |

