## 7. What NOT to Do

- ❌ Never use `#10B981`, `#0EA5E9`, `#EC4899` — old brand colors
- ❌ Never import Space Grotesk or any Google Font for the Latin body stack
- ❌ Never use `font-weight: 800` or `900` on TestFoundersGrotesk
- ❌ Never use CSS gradient functions (`linear-gradient`, etc.) on product HTML under `NewUnera/`
- ❌ Never hardcode hex values that have a `--brand-*` or `--*` token equivalent
- ❌ Never save new-brand files outside `NewUnera/`
- ❌ Never delete or omit commented sections from the source — keep them as comments
- ❌ Never change `window.location.href` redirect targets in inline JS
- ❌ Never remove form fields, JS event listeners, or validation functions
- ❌ Never change `id`, `name`, `for`, `aria-describedby` associations
- ❌ Never use gradient text (`-webkit-background-clip: text`) on product pages
- ❌ Never use `../Brand Guide/Unera-Horizontal.png` — use the SVG files in `NewUnera/NewLogo/`
- ❌ Never add features, copy, or UI that wasn't in the source
